,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487854146,"data":"Unsloth: FlashInfer requires JIT compilation but libcuda.so (the CUDA driver stub that -lcuda needs) is not found.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487859338,"data":"  vLLM will use FLASH_ATTN attention + PyTorch sampler instead (works fine).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487864291,"data":"  To enable FlashInfer, install the missing tools:\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487868132,"data":"    nvcc  - install the CUDA toolkit or set CUDA_HOME to your CUDA installation\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487884121,"data":"    ninja - pip install ninja\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487887922,"data":"    libcuda.so - this image has the CUDA runtime but not the driver stub.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487891316,"data":"      Install cuda-compat / the CUDA toolkit's stubs, or point LIBRARY_PATH\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487894676,"data":"      at a directory containing libcuda.so (a symlink to libcuda.so.1 or to\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487898117,"data":"      /usr/local/cuda/compat/libcuda.so is enough).\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.487901371,"data":"  Installing the missing tools and calling again in the same session is\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":205.48790479,"data":"  enough: this probe re-runs on every load_vllm call.\n"}
